          "instances"
        ],
        "name": "Texture Out",
        "thumbnail_visible": true
      },
      "20": {
        "attributes": {
          "alignment": {
            "type": "integer",
            "value": 0
          },
          "fill": {
            "type": "bool",
            "value": false
          },
          "font-size": {
            "type": "float",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "X/Y TRANSLATION\n\nWe start off by creating translation parameters for the X and Y Axis.\nThe range of the sliders are set to 7680x4320 pixels (8k resolution).\nNote that the suffix of the input nodes are set to pixels. \nThis can be done in the node panel under the \"unit\" attribute."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 376.42242431640625,
          "width": 488.83880615234375,
          "x": -433.8536376953125,
          "y": 131.10372924804688
        },
        "class": {
          "id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
          "version": 1
        },
        "clock": "video",
        "color": "ffff6a00",
        "constants": {},
        "hidden": [
          "text",
          "alignment",
          "font-size",
          "fill"
        ],
        "name": "Comment",
        "thumbnail_visible": true
      },
      "21": {
        "attributes": {
          "alignment": {
            "type": "integer",
            "value": 0
          },
          "fill": {
            "type": "bool",
            "value": false
          },
          "font-size": {
            "type": "float",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "ROTATION & SCALING\n\nMore suffixes! Two Float In nodes are renamed to Rotation and Scale.\nThe degree and percent suffixes are used for readability.\nNote that this is only a visual upgrade, we still need to convert the 0-360 and 0-100 ranges back to 0 to 1. This can easily be done by using the Divide node."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 376.42242431640625,
          "width": 488.83880615234375,
          "x": -433.8536376953125,
          "y": 534.739990234375
        },
        "class": {
          "id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
          "version": 1
        },
        "clock": "video",
        "color": "fff26eb5",
        "constants": {},
        "hidden": [
          "text",
          "alignment",
          "font-size",
          "fill"
        ],
        "name": "Comment",
        "thumbnail_visible": true
      },
      "22": {
        "attributes": {
          "alignment": {
            "type": "integer",
            "value": 0
          },
          "fill": {
            "type": "bool",
            "value": false
          },
          "font-size": {
            "type": "float",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "TRANSFORMATION\n\nIn the final part of the patch, we'll be taking the original texture and applying the transform before sending it back out again."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 376.6287536621094,
          "width": 641.509521484375,
          "x": 601.397705078125,
          "y": 131.00074768066406
        },
        "class": {
          "id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
          "version": 1
        },
        "clock": "video",
        "color": "ffe53357",
        "constants": {},
        "hidden": [
