          "font-size",
          "fill"
        ],
        "name": "Comment",
        "thumbnail_visible": true
      },
      "23": {
        "attributes": {
          "alignment": {
            "type": "integer",
            "value": 0
          },
          "fill": {
            "type": "bool",
            "value": true
          },
          "font-size": {
            "type": "float",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "SMOOTH TRANSFORM\n\nIn this example we are creating an effect that can smoothly move, scale and rotate the texture. For this we'll be using the Smooth node a lot. This example also uses a lot of suffixes in the input node, so you get to learn about that too!\n\nThe patch could be expanded by making the X/Y Translation resolution independent (using the Patch Info node). You could add the anchor point too. The biggest upgrade would be the introduction of Curve nodes, giving you more control over how the transition is animated."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 247.01089477539062,
          "width": 488.8388366699219,
          "x": -433.853515625,
